blic","site_admin":false},"body":"Unsure if it's strictly necessary here, but on the off-chance that `ResourceUID::get_id_path` gets called on a non-main thread, this should probably lock too:\n\n```suggestion\n\tMutexLock l(mutex);\n\tunique_ids_copy.clear();\n```\n\nThis should really be done for `ResourceUID::clear` as well.","created_at":"2026-09-01T12:35:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T13:39:37Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123024#discussion_r3904144098","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123024","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3904144098"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123024#discussion_r3904144098"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123024"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3904144098/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":427,"original_line":422,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":24,"position":36,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3904403406","pull_request_review_id":5078045846,"id":3904403406,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7ouHfO","diff_hunk":"@@ -406,6 +413,16 @@ void ResourceUID::clear() {\n \tchanged = false;\n }\n \n+#ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED\n+void ResourceUID::make_cache_copy() {\n+\tunique_ids_copy = unique_ids;","path":"core/io/resource_uid.cpp","commit_id":"2358a7af19769e80d6cebb580e30d71f0d3d3089","original_commit_id":"2358a7af19769e80d6cebb580e30d71f0d3d3089","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","follower